    <h1>João Victor Meneghel</h1>
    <p class="lede">I work between raw data and the people who have to decide something with it. I'm based in Espírito Santo, Brazil, and I'm open to remote and international roles.</p>
    <p>At the Anchieta city government I manage the official channels (past 10 million views), inspect public contracts and built the citizen service chatbot. Before that, I ran the digital side of the campaign that won a mayoral race in Alfredo Chaves with 58% in the first round, after five straight losses in the same city.</p>
